{% comment %}
  satc-config — single source of truth for Sticky ATC storefront config.

  Resolves app metafield config (camelCase keys) with Theme Editor block
  settings as fallback, applies blank defaults, computes page_ok flags, then
  renders satc-bar and (unless render_mode == 'bar') satc-slider.

  Liquid render isolates variables, so this snippet is the orchestrator:
  it passes the resolved values to the child snippets as named arguments.

  Params:
    block        — the app block / embed (required)
    render_mode  — 'all' (default: bar + drawer) or 'bar' (bar only)
{% endcomment %}

